    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CARA: Can you stop someplace? I'm severely under-caffeinated.\nAMY: Did you see the poster for the formal? The theme is \"Hope\"?\nBEE: I know. They asked me to be on the committee again but I was like -- hope is completely 2008. Grow up.",
      "AMY: Now?\nJANE: I have dinner on--",
      "AMY: What? How am I going to get hurt? Tell me. Charlie-- Now there's another KNOCK at the door. Jane comes downstairs-\nJANE: I got it--",
      "AMY: I can drive--\nJANE: I drive! They jump into Jane's car. Hit the garage opener--",
      "AMY: We won't stay up all night. Bee and Cara need help with Trig -- it's not a party. Okay. Okay...\nJANE: Who lies motionless in a bed. A doctor checks her chart. AMY hangs up. Charlie, finished with the cops, joins her. They're both pained as th…\nAMY: Maybe you should have said something to the police."
    ]
